    <TD>Estimated solely for the purpose of calculating the registration fee pursuant to Rules 457(c) and 457(h) of the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the &ldquo;Securities Act&rdquo;), and based upon the average of the high and low prices of the Registrant&rsquo;s common stock as reported on the Nasdaq Global Select Market on February 2, 2023.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(2)</FONT></TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Pursuant to Rule 416(a) under the Securities Act, this registration statement shall also cover any additional securities which may be offered or issued under the Praxis Precision Medicines, Inc. 2020 Stock Option and Incentive Plan (the &ldquo;2020 Plan&rdquo;) and the Praxis Precision Medicines, Inc. 2020 Employee Stock Purchase Plan (the &ldquo;2020 ESPP&rdquo;) to prevent dilution resulting from any stock split, stock dividend or similar transaction. In addition, pursuant to Rule 416(c) under the Securities Act, this registration statement also covers an indeterminate amount of interests to be offered or sold pursuant to the employee benefit plans described herein.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

